Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 19:42:55 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Logout via DELETE request

Replace the GET /logout route with DELETE /logout. The navbar "Sair"
link becomes a POST form carrying _method=DELETE, which the Request
reads to override the HTTP verb. Logging out is a state change and
must not be reachable by a plain link or address bar.

Tests: _method override in RequestTest; GET /logout now 404 and
DELETE /logout redirects to /login in LogoutAccessTest; destroy action
exercised through a new delete() helper in ControllerTestCase.
